; mtd_n0300.xml and mtd_n0510.xml are the MTD_MSIL2A.xml (asset
; product-metadata) of two Sentinel-2 L2A items of Microsoft's Planetary
; Computer on tile 33UUU, fetched unchanged on 2026-11-11 by
;   T=$(curl -s https://planetarycomputer.microsoft.com/api/sas/v1/token/sentinel-2-l2a |
;     sed -e 's/.*"token": *"\([^"]*\)".*/\1/' -e 's/\\u0026/\&/g')
;   curl -o F "URL?$T"
; with F, URL:
;   mtd_n0300.xml, https://sentinel2l2a01.blob.core.windows.net/sentinel2-l2/33/U/UU/2021/06/27/S2B_MSIL2A_20210627T100559_N0300_R022_T33UUU_20210628T031702.SAFE/MTD_MSIL2A.xml
;   mtd_n0510.xml, https://sentinel2l2a01.blob.core.windows.net/sentinel2-l2/33/U/UU/2024/06/29/S2A_MSIL2A_20240629T102021_N0510_R065_T33UUU_20240629T161811.SAFE/MTD_MSIL2A.xml
;
; mtd_l1c_n0510.xml is the MTD_MSIL1C.xml of the Level-1C product of
; mtd_n0510.xml's acquisition, ESA's processing, from Google's public bucket,
; fetched on 2026-11-16 by
;   curl -O https://storage.googleapis.com/gcp-public-data-sentinel-2/tiles/33/U/UU/S2A_MSIL1C_20240629T102021_N0510_R065_T33UUU_20240629T135511.SAFE/MTD_MSIL1C.xml
; and cut to its product information and image characteristics, without the
; image file list or the spectral responses, by
;   sed -e '/<IMAGE_FILE>/d' -e '/<Spectral_Response>/,/<\/Spectral_Response>/d' \
;     -e '/<n1:Geometric_Info>/,/<\/n1:Quality_Indicators_Info>/d' MTD_MSIL1C.xml
;
; mtd_tl_n0510.xml is the MTD_TL.xml (asset granule-metadata) of mtd_n0510.xml's
; tile, fetched by the commands above on 2026-11-16 from
;   https://sentinel2l2a01.blob.core.windows.net/sentinel2-l2/33/U/UU/2024/06/29/S2A_MSIL2A_20240629T102021_N0510_R065_T33UUU_20240629T161811.SAFE/GRANULE/L2A_T33UUU_A047109_20240629T102556/MTD_TL.xml
; and cut from 627 KB to 43 KB: it keeps the Sun grid and four of the 91 view
; grids, B04's and B10's (bandId 3 and 10) at detectors 7 and 8, without
; its quality indicators, by
;   sed -e '/<n1:Quality_Indicators_Info/,/<\/n1:Quality_Indicators_Info>/d' \
;     -e '/bandId="\(3\|10\)" detectorId="[78]"/,/<\/Viewing_Incidence_Angles_Grids>/b' \
;     -e '/<Viewing_Incidence_Angles_Grids /,/<\/Viewing_Incidence_Angles_Grids>/d' MTD_TL.xml

